{"id":5090,"date":"2025-08-10T23:18:55","date_gmt":"2025-08-10T13:48:55","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/?page_id=5090"},"modified":"2025-08-11T23:56:24","modified_gmt":"2025-08-11T14:26:24","slug":"corporate-development","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/corporate-development\/","title":{"rendered":"Corporate Development"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"5090\" class=\"elementor elementor-5090\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-28ace4f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"28ace4f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-75389cc elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"75389cc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"255\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/marketing-channel-image-3-1024x327.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-4946\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/marketing-channel-image-3-1024x327.png 1024w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/marketing-channel-image-3-300x96.png 300w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/marketing-channel-image-3-768x246.png 768w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/marketing-channel-image-3-1536x491.png 1536w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/marketing-channel-image-3-2048x655.png 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0f39794 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0f39794\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Profitable \u00b7 Self-Funded \u00b7 Customer-First<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-063ee6b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"063ee6b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">FeedOps Strategic Partnerships &amp; Corporate Development <br><\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ec11393 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ec11393\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Built for Sustainable Growth --\n<b>FeedOps<\/b> was launched with founder capital from <b>Frank Grasso <\/b>after the sale of his performance-marketing agency. Profitable operations and steady, quarter-on-quarter revenue growth now fund all R&amp;D\u2014ensuring our roadmap is dictated by retailer and agency needs, not external milestones.\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d6e6ee7 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"d6e6ee7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"mailto:info@feedops.com?subject=Strategic%20Partnership%20Inquiry\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Let\u2019s Talk<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9d3e19c e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"9d3e19c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-259803a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"259803a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dba580c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"dba580c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-159f93d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"159f93d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><b>Why Partners Engage Us<\/b><\/h3><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b><i>Recurring-Revenue Momentum <\/i><\/b><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Consistent QoQ growth and high gross margins, driven by a sticky SaaS model with over 20% CAGR and positive cashflow.<\/span><\/i><\/li><\/ul><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b><i>Exceptional Retention <\/i><\/b><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Net revenue-retention rates above industry benchmarks; customers expand usage over time.<\/span><\/i><\/li><\/ul><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b><i>Differentiated Technology<\/i><\/b><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Proprietary AI engine enriches product data at scale, lifting ROAS without extra media spend.<\/span><\/i><\/li><\/ul><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b><i>Scalable Infrastructure <\/i><\/b><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cloud-native architecture and 99.9% uptime support rapid global expansion at minimal incremental cost.<\/span><\/i><\/li><\/ul><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b><i>Data Moat <\/i><\/b><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Billions of product-attribute signals refined across search, social, and marketplace channels\u2014constantly improving our models.<\/span><\/i><\/li><\/ul><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b><i>Execution Velocity <\/i><\/b><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Agile release cadence and a culture of ownership\u2014every key contributor holds equity, ensuring alignment and speed.<\/span><\/i><\/li><li aria-level=\"1\"><b><i>Compliance &amp; Trust <\/i><\/b><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">SOC 2\u2013ready processes, GDPR compliance, and enterprise-grade security keep retailer data safe and auditors satisfied.<\/span><\/i><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f5414da e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"f5414da\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b62d5a1 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b62d5a1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">What We\u2019re Looking For\n<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8ed5340 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8ed5340\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We\u2019re not raising a round, but we welcome conversations that amplify customer value, including:<\/span><\/i><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e6cdd94 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e6cdd94\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;gradient&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3030fac e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3030fac\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-51ce570 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"51ce570\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0d7cd0d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0d7cd0d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3f5582c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3f5582c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Strategic Focus<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-70615c8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"70615c8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a77f9fd elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"a77f9fd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Ideal Partner Contribution\n\n<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c8bdd63 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c8bdd63\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e66e931 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e66e931\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-556e8cf elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"556e8cf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Channel Expansion\n\n<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bde2f81 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"bde2f81\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-23905f9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"23905f9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Exclusive media, marketplace, or distribution relationships\n\n<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-03fe685 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"03fe685\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-69b82ca e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"69b82ca\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-90fe31f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"90fe31f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Technology Acceleration\n\n<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5079bd5 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5079bd5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-29023bd elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"29023bd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">AI\/ML, data-enrichment, or complementary SaaS capabilities<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d341bb5 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d341bb5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ecb5f82 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ecb5f82\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9c92094 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"9c92094\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Global Reach\n\n<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-975f8fc e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"975f8fc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8058731 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8058731\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Regional go-to-market scale, enterprise sales networks<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bb3f515 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"bb3f515\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b994770 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b994770\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-573a4ea elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"573a4ea\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">M&amp;A Opportunities\n\n<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5ae99d6 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5ae99d6\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-de6493a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"de6493a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Select tuck-ins or minority investments that deepen our core offering\n\n<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-272843e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"272843e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any collaboration must strengthen the product and preserve our customer-first culture.<\/span><\/i><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a562814 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"a562814\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1cdbb99 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1cdbb99\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a4f1617 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a4f1617\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d8896ef e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d8896ef\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0175397 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"0175397\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Let\u2019s Talk\n<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ac04b7a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ac04b7a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If your expertise and network can multiply FeedOps\u2019 impact, contact our corporate-development team:\u00a0<\/span><\/i><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6f549a3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6f549a3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-740de96 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"740de96\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Email: info@feedops.com\n<br \/>\nSubject: Strategic Partnership Inquiry<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-89be2e9 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"89be2e9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"mailto:info@feedops.com?subject=Strategic%20Partnership%20Inquiry\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Let\u2019s Talk<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Profitable \u00b7 Self-Funded \u00b7 Customer-First FeedOps Strategic Partnerships &amp; Corporate Development Built for Sustainable Growth &#8212; FeedOps was launched with founder capital from Frank Grasso after the sale of his performance-marketing agency. Profitable operations and steady, quarter-on-quarter revenue growth now fund all R&amp;D\u2014ensuring our roadmap is dictated by retailer and agency needs, not external milestones. [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":11,"featured_media":5041,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-5090","page","type-page","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.6 (Yoast SEO v26.6) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>FeedOps Strategic Partnerships | Sustainable Growth<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Explore FeedOps Strategic Partnerships. We collaborate with media, marketplace, and technology leaders to expand channels, accelerate AI capabilities, and deliver greater value to retailers and agencies worldwide.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com